# N4: the player at e1m1's start, its own eye, god mode, with the grenade launcher
# (`impulse 9`, `impulse 6`): it jumps (file seconds 2.0, 5.5, 10.0, 14.0) and fires
# grenades down the corridor (3.0, 7.0, 12.0) ("jumps peak higher"). Slop at 1920x1080,
# the status bar and the gun.

map e1m1

duration 19.3
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
player 480,-352,88,90
cvar gamma 0.8

impulse 9 at 0
impulse 6 at 0.1
cmd +jump at 2.0
cmd -jump at 2.3
attack on at 3.0
attack off at 3.4
cmd +jump at 5.5
cmd -jump at 5.8
attack on at 7.0
attack off at 7.4
cmd +jump at 10.0
cmd -jump at 10.3
attack on at 12.0
attack off at 12.4
cmd +jump at 14.0
cmd -jump at 14.3

camera player

sound on
events on
